From 2734c9356318e0325c341856246aab955bacffc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:46:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/27] Typer: corrections to sigrounds from the design review;
 heightbound experiment

sigrounds: only declarations whose signature is a type expression are in the
table (not context parameters, not givens whose type is inferred); the
signature of an enclosing declaration with a where clause is computed before a
declaration inside it; the given index and the abstract model are unavailable
during the rounds; the self-check runs every round in both orders.

heightbound: implicit resolution bounds the nesting of premises instead of the
number of givens used, with a work budget past the former bound.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tJP7hLkrpGFxEq7K6r
